  "content": "<p>\n  使<strong>不死图腾</strong>在手持时显示为<strong>动画化的河豚桶</strong>，由Punchy和Refined Buckets驱动。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0b566fb8def522cb658008a9a49539e9c16678c3_0.webp\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"手持时河豚桶代替不死图腾的效果\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/lqNBiv3L/images/5d2f2d918a9f0193a9c74b6eaa07606227392e95.gif\"\n       width=\"420\"\n       alt=\"动画演示：图腾在手持时变为动画河豚桶\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><em>动画演示：背包中为普通图腾，手持时为动画河豚桶</em></p>\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🔗 前置需求</h3>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/refined-buckets\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f76489844cb9eca9c773e370b5c982ad3ef05fa.png\"\n         width=\"300\"\n         alt=\"需要Refined Buckets资源包\">\n  </a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fad1074568a3441a24b311f5b453c45bb9e2b619.png\"\n         width=\"270\"\n         alt=\"需要Punchy模组\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n### ⚙️ 安装方法\n\n1. 安装 **Refined Buckets** 和 **Punchy**\n2. 将此资源包放置在 **Refined Buckets 之上**\n\n**故障排除**\n- 如果手持物品出现错位或行为异常，请尝试在Punchy设置中禁用*物品物理*功能\n\n### 📜 鸣谢\n\n- Refined Buckets 提供模型和动画\n- Punchy 提供物品动画系统",
